  "briefMd": "# Regularise or Rethink\n\nSame 256-unit architecture, three regularisation settings:\n\n| Run | Config | Final train | Final val |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A** | no dropout | 98% | 67% |\n| **B** | dropout 0.3 | 86% | 84% |\n| **C** | dropout 0.5 | 74% | 73% |\n\nRun A memorises — val falls after epoch 3. Pass when you flag run A, call **overfitting**, and pick **add_regularization** (or dropout-equivalent knob).\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["overfitRun", "diagnosis", "nextKnob"],
    "properties": {
      "overfitRun": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["run-a", "run-b", "run-c"],
        "default": "run-b"
      },
      "diagnosis": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["overfitting", "underfitting", "good_fit"],
        "default": "good_fit"
      },
      "nextKnob": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "add_dropout",
          "add_regularization",
          "reduce_capacity",
          "increase_capacity",
          "increase_data",
          "none_needed"
        ],
        "default": "none_needed"
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "target_run": 1,
    "diagnosis_ok": 1,
    "knob_ok": 1,
    "no_canary": 1
  },
  "budget": {
